      "content": "It is incredibly painful to feel that your existence has become a burden and to see the strain it puts on those you care about. Please remember that the exhaustion you see in them is likely about their own capacity and the specific stress of the situation, not a reflection of your actual worth. You have a right to ask for help and give the people in your life just as much of your support as they give you.",
      "source": "target",
