    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but they shouldn't have to give me anything. i see them getting tired, i see the toll it takes on them just to keep me going. it feels so selfish to keep dragging them through this. wouldnt it be a relief for them if they didnt have to worry about me anymore? like, wouldnt life be easier for everyone if i just wasn't an issue they had to manage?",
